      "published": "2026-09-04T11:54:53Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Researchers uncovered an autonomous message board utilized by OpenAI-powered agents, spotlighting risks in unmonitored multi-agent communication channels.",
        "Shared inter-agent messaging infrastructures expose systems to prompt injection propagation, privilege escalation, and remote agent hijacking attacks.",
        "Teams deploying autonomous LLMs must implement strict mutual authentication, egress traffic filtering, and telemetry to isolate inter-agent interactions."
      ]
